aunch Action data model (Rust structs)\n2. Launch Profile Manager (CRUD for profiles)\n3. Simple UI to display and run a profile\n\nLet me create a detailed plan and then start executing it iteratively.\n\nSince this is a big explanation + plan, I'll structure this as:\n1. Full architecture explanation\n2. Concrete iterative plan\n3. Start step 1",
